{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47226","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 一 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南有天台事可尊，孕灵含秀独超羣。\n重重曲涧侵危石，步步层岩踏碎云。\n金雀每从云里现，异香多向夜深闻。\n当知此界非凡界，一道幽奇各自分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}